        <name>permissive</name>
        <qualifiedname>cuvis_export_general_settings_t::permissive</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Set exporter to &quot;permisive mode&quot;</para>
<para>If set, errors will be skipped and alternative values assumed, wherever possible.</para>
<para>E.g., if add_pan is selected but there is no panchromatic image avaialbe, the export is not possible. In permissive mode, however, the add_pan option is de-activated and an exprot without pan image is conducted instead.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>This mode may lead to unexpected behaviour and should be used with caution. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
